  "body": "Enjoy the benefits of an elevated position with excellent nature light, and a layout designed to grow with your family.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new four-bedroom home offers a refreshing alternative to the standard new-build. Set on an elevated section within the Strathmill community, it enjoys a bright, open feel and a sunny backyard perfect for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n•  Four bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n\r\n• Spacious open-plan living, kitchen and dining positioned on the upper level\r\n\r\n• Central air conditioning\r\n\r\n• Sound system\r\n\r\n• Flexible accommodation across both floors\r\n\r\n• Easy-care, low-maintenance living\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n• Zoned for Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College\r\n\r\nModern, practical, and positioned to make the most of its surroundings, this is a home that delivers both comfort and long-term value.\r\n\r\nContact us now for more information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
